message: "If you use these data or code, please cite this repository using the metadata below."

title: "Data and code for: Monalonion dissimulatum (Miridae) in Peruvian cacao: Integration of DNA sequences and morphology for its identification and the study of its biological cycle in the Amazonas region"

type: dataset

authors:
