    affiliation: "Universidad Nacional Toribio Rodríguez de Mendoza"

abstract: >
  This repository contains the data and analysis code supporting the study
  of Monalonion dissimulatum in cacao plantations in the Amazonas region
  of Peru. The deposited materials include data used for morphological and
  molecular identification, assessment of the biological cycle, and
  evaluation of the incidence and damage associated with M. dissimulatum
  in cacao plantations.

